      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Human biases make AI seem conscious, but consciousness likely depends on living biology, not computation, so building or believing in conscious machines is a mistake.",
      "question": "Could artificial intelligence ever be conscious, and how should we treat the possibility? (an argument with a recommendation)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
    },
