      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Psychological biases, not evidence, make us bundle intelligence with consciousness and see minds in machines that merely talk well.",
      "question": "Why do people assume AI could be conscious? (a list of psychological biases)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
