      "title": "Consciousness & Computation",
      "gist": "Four separate arguments suggest that computation alone, however sophisticated, is not enough to produce consciousness, because brains are not really computers.",
      "question": "Is computation sufficient for consciousness? (four arguments)",
      "sourceHeading": "Consciousness & Computation"
    },
