      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-affgsh",
        "spya-gamzr3"
      ],
      "title": "Beyond Turing's limits",
      "gist": "Many real-world processes are continuous or random rather than step-by-step symbol manipulation, so assuming only Turing-style computation matters for consciousness is presumptuous."
    },
