        "spya-e7jqx4",
        "spya-pfkhtt"
      ],
      "title": "3: Life Matters",
      "gist": "Consciousness may depend on being alive, since conscious experience looks like the brain's best guesses about bodily survival needs, rooted in the same self-sustaining processes found in every living cell.",
      "sourceHeading": "3: Life Matters"
    },
    "n0098": {
      "id": "n0098",
      "depth": 3,
      "parent": "n0097",
      "children": [
