        "n0100",
        "n0101"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-e7jqx4",
        "spya-hrydkk"
      ],
      "title": "Biological naturalism",
      "gist": "Every agreed case of consciousness is also alive, so philosopher John Searle's idea that life is necessary, though perhaps not sufficient, for consciousness deserves serious consideration."
    },
