      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-cqh5wq",
        "spya-tb4wr2"
      ],
      "title": "Maps are not territories",
      "gist": "A computational simulation of something only brings that thing into being if the thing itself is already a computational process, which is precisely the unproven assumption behind conscious AI."
    },
