      "title": "Mind uploading and the simulation hypothesis",
      "gist": "Hopes of uploading minds into detailed brain simulations, and even Bostrom's simulation hypothesis about our whole universe, quietly assume that a suitably programmed computer would be conscious, an assumption never actually examined."
    },
