        "spya-w8z40d"
      ],
      "title": "Soul Machine",
      "gist": "AI mirrors us so closely that mistaking its computations for inner life makes us both overrate machines and underrate the living, embodied feeling of being human.",
      "question": "What follows for how we should see ourselves given AI's rise? (a closing reflection)",
      "sourceHeading": "Soul Machine"
    },
